  43:app/prog/firmware_update/Programmer/prog_user_task_config.c ****     /*
  44:app/prog/firmware_update/Programmer/prog_user_task_config.c ****     BE CAREFUL!
  45:app/prog/firmware_update/Programmer/prog_user_task_config.c ****     - SIZE OF FUNCTION
  46:app/prog/firmware_update/Programmer/prog_user_task_config.c ****        User-specific code will inflate Programmer's size which may 
  47:app/prog/firmware_update/Programmer/prog_user_task_config.c ****        result in overlapping with other memory sections. In such cases 
  48:app/prog/firmware_update/Programmer/prog_user_task_config.c ****        enlargement of Programmer's reserved space might be needed.
  49:app/prog/firmware_update/Programmer/prog_user_task_config.c ****     - DURATION TIME OF FUNCTION
  50:app/prog/firmware_update/Programmer/prog_user_task_config.c ****        Be aware of keeping optimized code in user specific function. Not well
  51:app/prog/firmware_update/Programmer/prog_user_task_config.c ****        optimized user specific function can affect a runtime of Programmer.
  52:app/prog/firmware_update/Programmer/prog_user_task_config.c ****     - STATES OF FUNCTION
  53:app/prog/firmware_update/Programmer/prog_user_task_config.c ****        Be aware of fact that return values of user specific function are ignored.
  54:app/prog/firmware_update/Programmer/prog_user_task_config.c ****        The user specific function call is performed in simple endless loop unlike
  55:app/prog/firmware_update/Programmer/prog_user_task_config.c ****        a call in the scheduler.
  56:app/prog/firmware_update/Programmer/prog_user_task_config.c ****     */
  57:app/prog/firmware_update/Programmer/prog_user_task_config.c ****     
  58:app/prog/firmware_update/Programmer/prog_user_task_config.c ****     /*
  59:app/prog/firmware_update/Programmer/prog_user_task_config.c ****     Add user specific code there.
  60:app/prog/firmware_update/Programmer/prog_user_task_config.c ****     */
